<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-006" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov" source-id="s-nanqishu006-jianwu1-nov-kr787dd9a7">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">十一月癸酉以西中郎長史始安王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0014" ref="nnf_opw_w90">遥光</persName>為揚州刺史晉夀太守<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0025" ref="x5x_efh_1m8">王洪範</persName>為青冀二州刺史尚書令<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0038" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">王晏</persName>領太子少傅甲戌大司馬尋陽公<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0053" ref="w3c_uh3_9up">王敬則</persName>等十三人進爵邑各有差詔省新林苑先是民地悉以還主原責本直庚辰立皇子<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0088" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">寳義</persName>為晉安王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0094" ref="w4m_9tw_147_B">寳𤣥</persName>為江夏王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0100" ref="w4m_9tw_147_C">寳源</persName>為廬陵王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0106" ref="w4m_9tw_147_D">寳寅</persName>為建安王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0112" ref="w4m_9tw_147_E">寳融</persName>為随郡王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0118" ref="w4m_9tw_147_F">寳攸</persName>為南平王甲申詔曰邑宰禄薄俸微不足代耕雖任土恒貢亦為勞費自今悉斷又詔宣城國五品以上悉與滿叙自此以下皆聽解遣其欲仕適所樂乙酉追尊<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0182" ref="k0w_fqp_8ny">始安貞王</persName>為景皇<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0189" ref="ia4_nof_r6b">妃</persName>為懿后丙戌以輔國将軍聞喜公<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0203" ref="irb_gnh_ex3">遥欣</persName>為荆州刺史寧朔将軍豐城公<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0217" ref="pnj_l6g_jvt">遥昌</persName>為豫州刺史丁亥詔細作中署材官車府凡諸工可悉開番假逓令休息戊子立皇太子<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0253" ref="qrq_1hs_ggc">寳卷</persName>賜天下為父後者爵一級孝子順孫義夫節婦普加甄賜眀揚表其衡閭賚以束帛己丑詔東宫肇建逺近或有慶禮可悉斷之壬辰以新除征虜将軍江夏王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0316" ref="w4m_9tw_147_B">寳𤣥</persName>為郢州刺史永眀中御史中丞<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0330" ref="wq9_s7y_0wh">沈淵</persName>表百官年登七十皆令致仕竝窮困私門庚子詔曰日者百司耆齒許以自陳東西二省猶沾微俸辭事私庭榮禄兼謝興言愛老實有矜懐自縉紳年及可一遵永眀七年以前銓叙之科<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-jianwu1-nov:p001:m0404" ref="w4m_9tw_147">上</persName>輔政所誅諸王是月復屬籍各封子為侯</p>
</text>
